{"version":1,"content":"<p>天文學家最新研究發現，太陽中的銀含量比此前認為的高出約55%。這一結果不僅修正了人們對太陽化學成分的認識，也讓太陽的銀豐度更接近原始隕石中記錄的水平。研究人員指出，太陽和這些古老隕石都保留了46億年前形成太陽系的那團氣體和塵埃雲的物質痕跡。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1588256.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T17:44:20.597227+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T17:35:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T17:37:33.498128+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T17:37:33.498128+00:00","content_hash":"614fc720caf35593bdcf5c6078302b211df1ad02f8caa174b15c5a77008c0fb6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}